title: Letter
---
Maia: ...
Maia: *sigh*
Maia: I wonder why mamu even bothers trying to be pleasant.
Maia: And by Sunday? Surely, he couldn't have meant today. 
Maia: Unless... the post got delayed by the rain and this letter was supposed to arrive a week ago. 
===

title: Phone
---
<<declare $firstMamuCall = true>>
<<declare $isSmoke = false>>
Mamu: Hello?
Mamu: Maia beta, how is the packing coming along?
Maia: Hello mamu. 
Maia: I hope you are well too. 
<<smoke Phone>> 
Maia: Umm... I haven't started packing yet. I actully just got your letter.
Mamu: What? That can't be right. I mailed it more than a week ago.
Mamu: You must have left it lying around and forgotten about it.
Maia: No, I received it today. It's been raining non-stop so-
<<audio_sfx AudioManager Smoke Loop>>
Mamu: Listen Maia, the movers are already on their way. They will be there by evening.
Mamu: So, I suggest you gather whatever's worth something and leave nani ka ghar as soon as you can.
Mamu: Come over to our place. Stay with us for a while. I miss you, you know?
Maia: Mamu, I-  Wait, what's that smell?
Mamu: I'm sorry?
Maia: Something's burning!
Mamu: Well, I'll let you go see to that. Hope you don't burn the house down.
Mamu: Ha ha.
Mamu: Anyway, remember to have your things packed by six.
Maia: Mamu, you can't be serious right now. I really won't be able to do everything in just a few hours!
Mamu: Unfortunately, there's nothing we can do about it Maia. I hope to see you soon.
Maia: But I -
Mamu: Take care. 
Maia: ...
Mamu: Love you. 
<<audio_sfx AudioManager PhoneCut Once>>
<<wait 1>>
Maia: *sigh* 
===

title: NaniRoom
---
Maia: Oh, I don't think I am ready to step into nani's room just yet.
===

title: MaiaRoom
---
Maia: Oh great. 
Maia: Thanks to mamu's rambling, I forgot I had left a potion brewing in my room. 
Maia: It's no good now. I need to put this fire out.
===

title: Lamp
---
Maia: This lamp is the last present Nani gave me.
Maia: Can't believe it was just last week when I put it together and placed it here.
Maia: The<style="clue"> glasswork </style>is so pretty. The way it catches the sunlight and disperses it around the room reminds me of... well...
Maia: It reminds me of nani ka ghar. Which is an odd thought because... this is nani ka ghar...
===

title: InventoryItem
---
<<declare $itemName = "">>
<style="inventory"> {$itemName} </style>added to inventory!
<<if $itemName == "Jalpari Scales">>
    Maia: Guess I have no reason to hide this in here anymore.
<<endif>>
===

title: Rag
---
Maia: A<style="wrong"> dry cloth </style>would work great if I truly wanted to bring the house down.
===

title: Potion
---
Maia: Any later, and mamu wouldn't have had a house to claim.
Maia: It's such a shame though. The<style="clue"> Sundrip potion's </style>fragrance is nani's favourite.
Maia: Although, she thinks it's just some fancy perfume I get from afar. 
Maia: She often asks- asked... Oh. 
Maia: Nani... Umm... Nani used to ask me what it was made of.
Maia: Of course I couldn't tell her what was really in it... *sigh*
<<wait 1>>
Maia: Ugh. It smells so bad in here. 
Maia: I think I'll make the potion again to chase away the smell.
Maia: And I guess I'll just brew it in the kitchen now. 
Maia: With nani...not here... there's no point sneaking around and risking a forest fire again.
Maia: I should gather the ingredients.
===

title: PotionAdd
---
<style="inventory"> {$itemName} </style>added to pot!
===

title: SecondCall
---
Maia: Hello?
Mamu: Maia, how are things?
Maia: Not much different from two hours ago.
Mamu: Well, I just talked to the movers. They may be arriving sooner than expected.
Maia: Mamu... I don't think I can do this.
Mamu: Sure, you can. The value of nani ka ghar will only depreciate further the longer we wait.
Mamu: You know I have been insisting on selling this house for a long time. Only amma wouldn't listen...
Maia: I just...I need more time.
Mamu: Don't worry, I did tell the movers you will need some time.
Maia: ... 
Maia: Mamu, can I ask you something?
Mamu: Yes?
Maia: Why did you send me a letter when you could have just called.
Mamu: You didn't like the letter?
Maia: I mean, it has caused me two panic attacks within the last two hours, but aside from that, sure.
Mamu: Well, I'm sorry. I thought a letter might have helped land the news more softly.
Mamu: I really did want to tell you about my decision ealier but things got really chaotic on my end.
Mamu: I thought a letter would convey my sentiments better. But I guess, the younger generation can't be expected to appreciate <i>antiquites</i> like handwritten letters.
Maia: Right. 
Maia: I'll get going now. Bye.
<<audio_sfx AudioManager PhoneCut Once>>
===

title: PotionSuccess
---
Maia: Aah. The warm, pine-foresty smell never fails to lift spirits.
Maia: I wish nani were here.
Maia: And I wish that I had never had to keep any secrets from her.
Maia: If nani were here right now, I wouldn't care about anyhting. I would instantly spill all that I have been holding in these past years.
Maia: I would tell her about the potion and the jalpari scales and how I had acquired them. I would tell her about Ansharia, and I would tell her... who I really am.
Maia: Maybe then she would tell me her secrets too. Like the secret ingredient she adds in her Khaplu-famous momos.
Maia: *sigh* I wish you were here nani.
<<audio_sfx AudioManager DoorCreak Once>>
<<wait 3>>
Maia: Huh? What was that sound?
===

title: MagicDoorAppear
---
Maia: That's- 
Maia: What in the Ansharia?
Maia: There's a door here?!
Maia: I'm pretty sure there's never been a door here. 
Maia: I must be trippin-
<<wait 1>>
<<audio_sfx AudioManager PhoneRing Loop>>
<<wait 1>>
Maia: Oh! That scared me. 
Maia: God, what does mamu want now?
===

